# Keep the build context small and never ship host output, secrets or other checkouts into an image.
.git
.claude
.github
docs
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.open-next
**/.wrangler
**/.docker-out
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
**/*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
